<title>UK: World Bank sets 1.5 billion Czech crown Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 1.5 billion Czech crown Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    06.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.88    PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    100.03    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/GB/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
